#. Translators: App password is the name of Google's page; use the words Google's own
#. page shows in your language.
#: app/src/ui/gmail_password_page.rs:35
msgid "Sign in with an app password"
msgstr "Увійти з паролем програми"

#. Translators: Google is a name; keep it as it is.
#: app/src/ui/gmail_password_page.rs:46
msgid ""
"Google gives each app its own password. You make one in your Google account "
"and paste it here. Your Google password stays with Google."
msgstr ""
"Google дає кожній програмі власний пароль. Ви створюєте його у своєму "
"обліковому записі Google і вставляєте сюди. Ваш пароль Google залишається в "
"Google."

#. Translators: 2-Step Verification is Google's name for it; use the words Google's
#. own page shows in your language.
#: app/src/ui/gmail_password_page.rs:59
msgid "Turn on 2-Step Verification, if it isn't on yet."
msgstr "Увімкніть двоетапну перевірку, якщо вона ще не ввімкнена."

#. Translators: 2-Step Verification is Google's name for it; use the words Google's
#. own page shows in your language.
#: app/src/ui/gmail_password_page.rs:63
