#. Translators: App password and Penguin Mail are names; use the words Google's own
#. page shows in your language for App passwords.
#: app/src/ui/gmail_password_page.rs:71
msgid "Make an app password. Name it Penguin Mail."
msgstr "Створіть пароль програми. Назвіть його Penguin Mail."

#. Translators: Google is a name; keep it as it is.
#: app/src/ui/gmail_password_page.rs:83
msgid ""
"Copy the 16 letters Google shows and paste them below. Google shows them "
"only once."
msgstr ""
"Скопіюйте 16 літер, які показує Google, і вставте їх нижче. Google показує "
"їх лише раз."

#. Translators: Google is a name; keep it as it is. App passwords is the name of
#. Google's page; use the words Google's own page shows in your language.
#: app/src/ui/gmail_password_page.rs:92
msgid ""
"Changing your Google password removes your app passwords. Make a new one to "
"keep getting mail."
msgstr ""
"Якщо змінити пароль Google, паролі програм буде видалено. Створіть новий, "
"щоб і далі отримувати пошту."

#. Translators: App password is the name of Google's page; use the words Google's own
